zine: 4 sheets, 6 blanks
  sheet 1: front 8 1; back 2 7
  sheet 2: front 6 3; back 4 5
  sheet 3: front _ 9; back 10 _
  sheet 4: front _ _; back _ _
  audit: 10 distinct pages of 10
manga: 2 sheets, 1 blanks
  sheet 1: front 1 _; back 7 2
  sheet 2: front 3 6; back 5 4
  audit: 7 distinct pages of 7
flyer: 1 sheets, 3 blanks
  sheet 1: front _ 1; back _ _
  audit: 1 distinct pages of 1
empty: pages must be 1..1000
huge: pages must be 1..1000
bad: pages must be 1..1000
fold: signature must be 4..32 in multiples of four
zero: signature must be 4..32 in multiples of four
side: binding must be left or right
bad ticket: expected title pages signature binding
